#!grafli v1
# Character 101 — reveal storyboard
# Companion board to paper.md. Purpose: teaching — so this board is a
# STORYBOARD: one node per beat, in reveal order, mirroring the guided flow
# `character-tour` in Sandbox.qml exactly (same order, same vocabulary).
# Started 2026-09-11. If the flow gains or loses a step, this board changes
# in the same commit - the flow is the primary artifact and this is its map.

# ── entry ──
@ box paper "Paper →\nthe lesson plan" 60,60 220x80 %soft &link:./paper.md
@ note legend 960,60 """
press T in the lab
this board is that tour
""" ~small

# ── what they arrive with ──
@ box belief "THE BELIEF THEY ARRIVE WITH\n\"a character is a mesh with\nanimations attached - a new body\nneeds a new walk\"" 60,230 300x150 %accent &link:./paper.md#the-misconception-it-targets

# ── the beats, in reveal order ──
@ box beat1 "1 lineup\nsix builds, one walk, six tempos\nchild 0.656 s · eater 0.935 s\nflow step: lineup" 440,200 300x120 %primary &link:./paper.md#the-demonstration-sequence
@ box beat2 "2-3 gait\nthe elderly preset at eight phases\ncontacts, passing, then from above\nflow steps: gait, gaitTop" 440,350 300x120 %primary &link:./paper.md#the-demonstration-sequence
@ box beat3 "4-5 THEY switch to a run\n1.111 s becomes 0.625 s\nflow steps: try, run" 440,500 300x100 %teal &link:./paper.md#the-demonstration-sequence
@ box beat4 "6 gestures\nthirteen frozen columns, then S\nflow steps: gestures, silhouette" 440,630 300x100 %primary &link:./paper.md#the-demonstration-sequence
@ box beat5 "7-8 action, moves\nboxing 1.70 s a round, running\nfourteen moves, feet on the floor\nflow steps: action, moves" 440,760 300x120 %primary &link:./paper.md#the-demonstration-sequence
@ box beat6 "9-11 hands, faces, heads\npalm 1.10 arms · closest pair 1.206\nthree tiers at the working distance\nflow steps: hands, faces, heads" 800,200 300x120 %primary &link:./paper.md#the-demonstration-sequence
@ box beat7 "12-13 speech, conversation\nthree lip-sync tiers, one recording\na listener, or a body standing there\nflow steps: speech, conversation" 800,350 300x120 %primary &link:./paper.md#the-demonstration-sequence
@ box beat8 "14 crowd\ntwenty characters = 440 boxes\ndraws, not vertices\nflow step: crowd" 800,500 300x100 %primary &link:./paper.md#the-demonstration-sequence

# ── the moment ──
@ box moment "THE NUMBER THAT CONTRADICTS IT\nsix cycle lengths on the card\nbefore anyone presses a key -\nnobody animated a child's walk" 800,640 300x140 %rose &link:./paper.md#the-moment-the-number-contradicts-the-belief

# ── the takeaway ──
@ box takeaway "the takeaway\n\"a character is a model, not a file:\nchange the body and every animation\nfollows; change the model and\nevery character does\"" 800,810 300x140 %highlight &link:./paper.md#the-takeaway

# ── arrows ──
@ arrow belief -> beat1 "start here"
@ arrow beat1 -> beat2
@ arrow beat2 -> beat3
@ arrow beat3 -> beat4
@ arrow beat4 -> beat5
@ arrow beat5 -> beat6
@ arrow beat6 -> beat7
@ arrow beat7 -> beat8
@ arrow beat1 -> moment "already here" !dashed
@ arrow beat8 -> takeaway
@ arrow moment -> takeaway
@ arrow moment -> belief "revises" !dashed

# ── the lab itself ──
@ note scen 60,480 """
scenarios (keys 1-9, chips for all)
1 lineup · 2 gait · 3 gestures · 4 action
5 moves · 6 hands · 7 faces · 8 heads
9 speech · conversation · crowd
every scenario: a card that says what it
is for, its choices, its readings, its shots
""" ~small &link:./paper.md#measured-results

@ note keys 60,700 """
keys
1-9 scenarios · T tour · Space next · ← back
V card · M plot · S silhouette · N next shot
F frame · 0 reset · arrows/WASD travel
Shift+R record · Ctrl +/-/0 text size · ? all
""" ~small &link:./paper.md#how-to-run-it
